    "analysis": "\n      <h4>Matriz Comparativa de Ingeniería Rigurosa:</h4>\n      <table class=\"ac-table\" style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:12px 0; font-size:0.9rem;\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr style=\"background:#0056b3; color:#fff;\">\n            <th style=\"padding:8px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Topología</th>\n            <th style=\"padding:8px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">\\(Z_i\\)</th>\n            <th style=\"padding:8px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">\\(Z_o\\)</th>\n            <th style=\"padding:8px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">\\(A_v\\) (con \\(R_L\\))</th>\n            <th style=\"padding:8px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">\\(A_{vs}\\) (con \\(R_s\\))</th>\n            <th style=\"padding:8px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Desfase</th>\n            <th style=\"padding:8px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Función Principal</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\"><b>Emisor Común (CE)</b></td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Media (\\(\\approx 2.6\\,\\mathrm{k\\Omega}\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Media (\\(\\approx 3.3\\,\\mathrm{k\\Omega}\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Alta (\\(\\mathbf{-124.0}\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Alta (\\(\\mathbf{-100.8}\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc; text-align:center;\">\\(180^\\circ\\)</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Amplificación de Tensión y Potencia</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\">\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\"><b>Colector Común (CC)</b></td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Muy Alta (\\(\\approx 17.5\\,\\mathrm{k\\Omega}\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Muy Baja (\\(\\approx 23.5\\,\\Omega\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Casi 1 (\\(\\mathbf{+0.978}\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Casi 1 (\\(\\mathbf{+0.945}\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc; text-align:center;\">\\(0^\\circ\\)</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Adaptador de impedancias / Buffer</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\"><b>Base Común (CB)</b></td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Muy Baja (\\(\\approx 19.6\\,\\Omega\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Media (\\(\\approx 3.3\\,\\mathrm{k\\Omega}\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Alta (\\(\\mathbf{+124.0}\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Baja (\\(\\mathbf{+3.92}\\))</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc; text-align:center;\">\\(0^\\circ\\)</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:6px; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Receptor de RF / Fuentes de corriente</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n      <div class=\"box remember\" style=\"margin-top:14px; border-left: 4px solid #153a5b; background: #e9f0f6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n        <small style=\"text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; font-weight:800; color:#153a5b; display:block; margin-bottom:4px;\">💡 Analogía Pedagógica de Malvino & Criterio de Aula</small>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.5; color:#18212b;\"><b>Las tres herramientas del maestro artesano:</b> El Emisor Común es el martillo de fuerza (amplifica tensión y potencia con inversión de 180°). El Colector Común es el adaptador de llave inglesa (iguala impedancias y entrega corriente). La Base Común es el bisturí de precisión (máxima velocidad y ancho de banda en RF).</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"box key\" style=\"margin-top:10px; border-left: 4px solid #21705b; background: #e8f3ef; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n        <small style=\"text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; font-weight:800; color:#21705b; display:block; margin-bottom:4px;\">⚡ Unificación de Notación & Parámetros (Boylestad · Malvino · Sedra)</small>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.5; color:#18212b;\"><b>Cuadro resumen de impedancias y ganancias:</b> CE: \\(Z_i\\) media, \\(Z_o\\) media, \\(|A_v|\\) alta, desfase 180°. CC: \\(Z_i\\) muy alta, \\(Z_o\\) muy baja, \\(A_v \\approx +1\\), desfase 0°. CB: \\(Z_i\\) muy baja, \\(Z_o\\) media, \\(A_v\\) alta, desfase 0°.</p>\n      </div>\n      "
